## 3.1 Relationship rules

1. A profile belongs to one authenticated Supabase user.
2. A user may create many posts.
3. A post may receive many reactions and comments.
4. A poll contains multiple options.
5. A poll may receive multiple votes.
6. A user may have one active vote submission per poll, subject to the approved poll rules.
7. A game contains questions.
8. A game session belongs to one user and one game.
9. A game session contains answers.
10. A community has many members.
11. A user may belong to multiple communities.
12. A report is submitted by a user and may identify a target user or content record.
13. A report may have one or more moderation actions.
14. Notifications belong to their intended recipient.
15. Administrative and moderation actions must have auditable actors.

All relationships must be implemented with appropriate foreign keys or explicitly documented alternatives.

