| game_questions | Game and question ordering |
| game_options | Question option retrieval |
| game_sessions | User session history |
| game_answers | Session answer retrieval |
| community_members | Community membership lookup |
| notifications | Recipient and creation-time retrieval |
| notifications | Unread notification lookup |
| reports | Status and creation-time review queues |
| moderation_actions | Subject and moderator history |
| locations | Geospatial search |
