# 14. DATABASE PERFORMANCE

## 14.1 Query efficiency

Review:

- Feed retrieval.
- Comment retrieval.
- Reaction counts.
- Poll results.
- Game history.
- Notification retrieval.
- Moderation queues.
- Geospatial queries.

Use query plans to identify expensive operations.

## 14.2 Pagination

Use cursor-based pagination for large feeds and histories.

Avoid unbounded queries.

## 14.3 Index maintenance

Indexes must be reviewed against actual query patterns.

Do not create duplicate or unused indexes.

## 14.4 Geospatial performance

Use appropriate PostGIS indexes and spatial query patterns.

The implementation must confirm that location filtering remains privacy-preserving and performant.

